#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The traders weigh their silver on small scales: a broken piece of a bracelet buys as much as a "
"coin of the same weight."
msgstr ""
"Les marchands pèsent leur argent sur de petites balances : un bout de bracelet cassé vaut autant "
"qu'une pièce du même poids."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The combs of antler are so precious that people are buried with them."
msgstr "Les peignes en bois de cerf sont si précieux qu'on les enterre avec leurs propriétaires."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The vikings make their sails of wool; it takes a weaver a whole year to weave a big one."
msgstr ""
"Les Vikings font leurs voiles en laine ; il faut une année entière à une tisserande pour en tisser"
" une grande."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey is the only sweet the vikings know, so the bees are worth a lot."
msgstr "Le miel est la seule douceur que connaissent les Vikings, alors les abeilles valent cher."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The runes are carved in straight lines, so that they are easy to cut in wood and stone."
msgstr ""
"Les runes sont faites de traits droits, pour être faciles à graver dans le bois et la pierre."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "In winter, the lakes freeze, and people travel on skates made of horse bones."
msgstr "En hiver, les lacs gèlent, et les gens voyagent sur des patins en os de cheval."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "Women hold the keys of the house: a woman with keys on her belt runs the farm."
msgstr ""
"Les femmes gardent les clés de la maison : une femme avec des clés à la ceinture dirige la ferme."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The vikings give their boats names, like Long Serpent or Sea Horse."
msgstr "Les Vikings donnent des noms à leurs bateaux, comme Long Serpent ou Cheval de Mer."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "The cats on the farms catch the mice in the grain stores, so everybody loves them."
msgstr "Les chats des fermes attrapent les souris dans les greniers, alors tout le monde les aime."

#. a fun fact of the viking times, which a skipper tells, at most 2 short sentences
#: scenes/game/gossip.gd
#, fuzzy
msgid "A good horse is worth more than a whole boatload of fish."
msgstr "Un bon cheval vaut plus qu'un bateau entier plein de poissons."

