#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A good trader asks before she sells. Hail three boats on the lakes and ask about the price of "
"wool. Then sell a crate of wool where it pays."
msgstr ""
"Une bonne marchande se renseigne avant de vendre. {crew|Salue|Salue|Saluez} trois bateaux sur les "
"lacs et {crew|demande|demande|demandez} le prix de la laine. Puis {crew|vends|vends|vendez} une "
"caisse de laine là où elle rapporte le plus."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Now you know more than most traders! Sell your wool where they want it."
msgstr ""
"Maintenant, {crew|tu en sais|tu en sais|vous en savez} plus que la plupart des marchands ! "
"{crew|Vends|Vends|Vendez} {crew|ta|ta|votre} laine là où on la veut."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Wool? They always need it at the weaver in Guldvik."
msgstr "De la laine ? On en a toujours besoin chez la tisserande de Guldvik."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The market in Kråkhamn buys wool too, they say."
msgstr "Le marché de Kråkhamn achète aussi de la laine, à ce qu'on dit."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/005_news_on_the_water/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good soft wool! I will spin it into yarn and weave it into cloth. Thank you."
msgstr "Bonne laine bien douce ! Je vais la filer, puis la tisser pour en faire du tissu. Merci."

