#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/012_who_takes_the_honey/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Every night, a pot of honey is gone from my hives! Who takes it? Ask Old Halvard the ferryman, he "
"sees everything on the lakes."
msgstr ""
"Chaque nuit, un pot de miel disparaît de mes ruches ! Qui le prend ? "
"{crew|Demande|Demande|Demandez} au vieux Halvard, le passeur : il voit tout sur les lacs."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/012_who_takes_the_honey/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey? Ha! I saw paw prints on the shore by Svanetorp. Small ones. Ask Old Grim there."
msgstr ""
"Du miel ? Ha ! J'ai vu des traces de pattes sur la rive, près de Svanetorp. Des petites. "
"{crew|Demande|Demande|Demandez} au vieux Grim, là-bas."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/012_who_takes_the_honey/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Paw prints? Look in my woodshed... a bear cub, sticky with honey! His mother must be in the woods "
"by Hjortingsala. Take him to her, gently."
msgstr ""
"Des traces de pattes ? {crew|Regarde|Regarde|Regardez} dans ma remise à bois... un ourson, tout "
"collant de miel ! Sa mère doit être dans les bois près de Hjortingsala. "
"{crew|Ramène|Ramène|Ramenez}-le-lui, doucement."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/012_who_takes_the_honey/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "He is asleep in the basket. Row quietly!"
msgstr "Il dort dans le panier. {crew|Rame|Rame|Ramez} sans bruit !"

