#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/019_the_stable/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Ragnfrid's foal needs a stable before she comes. Bring six logs from Arne's forest in Frosttorp, a"
" crate of iron tools from the smith, and tar from Ekvik. Six logs are more than your boat holds!"
msgstr ""
"La pouliche de Ragnfrid a besoin d'une écurie avant d'arriver. {crew|Apporte|Apporte|Apportez} six"
" rondins de la forêt d'Arne, à Frosttorp, une caisse d'outils en fer du forgeron, et du goudron "
"d'Ekvik. Six rondins, c'est plus que {crew|ton|ton|votre} bateau ne peut porter !"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/019_the_stable/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Good straight pine. Load what fits, and come back for the rest."
msgstr ""
"Du bon pin bien droit. {crew|Charge|Charge|Chargez} ce qui tient, et "
"{crew|reviens|reviens|revenez} chercher le reste."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/019_the_stable/mission.json
#, fuzzy
