#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bees for Solby"
msgstr "Des abeilles pour Solby"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My apple trees bloom, but no bee visits them! Without bees, no apples. Buy a beehive from Alfhild "
"in Dimmberga and bring it to my orchard."
msgstr ""
"Mes pommiers sont en fleurs, mais aucune abeille ne vient ! Sans abeilles, pas de pommes. "
"{crew|Achète|Achète|Achetez} une ruche chez Alfhild, à Dimmberga, et "
"{crew|apporte|apporte|apportez}-la dans mon verger."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Listen to them hum! Now the flowers will become apples. Take these flowers for your farm."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Écoute|Écoute|Écoutez}-les bourdonner ! Maintenant, les fleurs vont devenir des pommes. "
"{crew|Prends|Prends|Prenez} ces fleurs pour {crew|ta|ta|votre} ferme."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/027_bees_for_solby/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bees carry the pollen from flower to flower, so that the fruits grow."
msgstr "Les abeilles portent le pollen de fleur en fleur, pour que les fruits poussent."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Lost Lamb"
msgstr "L'agneau perdu"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"One of the lambs from the cold night is gone! The little one with the black ear. Ask Freya and "
"Liv, they paddle everywhere in their canoe."
msgstr ""
"Un des agneaux de la nuit froide a disparu ! Le petit à l'oreille noire. "
"{crew|Demande|Demande|Demandez} à Freya et Liv, elles pagaient partout dans leur canoë."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A lamb with a black ear? We saw one on Laxön, eating Tova's flowers!"
msgstr "Un agneau à l'oreille noire ? On en a vu un à Laxön, qui mangeait les fleurs de Tova !"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "She swam over! Can you imagine? She is wet but well. Take her home."
msgstr ""
"Il a traversé à la nage ! {crew|Tu te rends compte|Tu te rends compte|Vous vous rendez compte} ? "
"Il est mouillé, mais il va bien. {crew|Ramène|Ramène|Ramenez}-le à la maison."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/028_the_lost_lamb/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Black Ear! She runs to her mother. Keep the other lamb of that ewe: she likes you."
msgstr ""
"Oreille Noire ! Il court vers sa mère. {crew|Garde|Garde|Gardez} l'autre agneau de cette brebis : "
"il {crew|t'aime|t'aime|vous aime} bien."

