#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Autumn comes, and the animals catch colds. Take my herbs to those who need them: two bundles to "
"the horse farm, two to the herders, two to Gudrun's inn."
msgstr ""
"L'automne arrive, et les animaux s'enrhument. {crew|Porte|Porte|Portez} mes herbes à ceux qui en "
"ont besoin : deux bouquets au haras, deux aux bergers, deux à l'auberge de Gudrun."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Herbs from Tova! Now the cow and the calf stay well all winter."
msgstr "Des herbes de Tova ! Maintenant, la vache et le veau resteront en bonne santé tout l'hiver."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/029_herbs_for_the_lakes/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "All delivered? You are real helpers now. Take these herbs for your own animals."
msgstr ""
"Tout est livré ? {crew|Tu es un vrai assistant|Tu es une vraie assistante|Vous êtes de vrais "
"assistants|Vous êtes de vraies assistantes} maintenant. {crew|Prends|Prends|Prenez} ces herbes "
"pour {crew|tes|tes|vos} animaux."

