#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
msgctxt "acc"
msgid "the syrup"
msgstr ""

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/052_the_coughing_horse/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Honey helps a sore throat, for horses as for people."
msgstr "Le miel soigne les maux de gorge, chez les chevaux comme chez les gens."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Lame Goat"
msgstr "La chèvre qui boite"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My best goat, Hedda, limps! A thorn, I think, but she won't let me look. Take her to Tova on "
"Laxön. She takes the room of a crate, and she butts!"
msgstr ""
"Ma meilleure chèvre, Hedda, boite ! Une épine, je crois, mais elle ne me laisse pas regarder. "
"{crew|Emmène|Emmène|Emmenez}-la chez Tova, à Laxön. Elle prend la place d'une caisse, et elle "
"donne des coups de tête !"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hold her head, gently... There: a big thorn. Leave her with me tonight, with a herb wrap."
msgstr ""
"{crew|Tiens|Tiens|Tenez}-lui la tête, doucement... Voilà : une grosse épine. "
"{crew|Laisse|Laisse|Laissez}-la-moi cette nuit, avec un pansement aux herbes."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hedda! She jumps like a kid again. Here, the best cheese I have."
msgstr ""
"Hedda ! Elle saute de nouveau comme un cabri. {crew|Tiens|Tiens|Tenez}, mon meilleur fromage."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "She walks well again. Take her home!"
msgstr "Elle marche bien de nouveau. {crew|Ramène|Ramène|Ramenez}-la à la maison !"

#. a thing of a task, under its crate: at most 10 letters
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hedda"
msgstr "Hedda"

#. a thing of a task; {count|...|...} picks the form for the number {count} (one, then the others;
#. see the Plural-Forms of this file for how many forms your language has), e.g., '{count|a crate of
#. salt|{count} crates of salt}'
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hedda the goat"
msgstr "Hedda la chèvre"

#. the thing 'Hedda the goat' for {thing@acc} in the translations: the accusative (the direct
#. object), e.g. 'бочку эля', 'bačvu piva'; leave it empty if it is the same as the plain
#. translation
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
msgctxt "acc"
msgid "Hedda the goat"
msgstr ""

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/053_the_lame_goat/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Goats climb anything: rocks, roofs, and sometimes boats."
msgstr "Les chèvres grimpent partout : sur les rochers, sur les toits, et parfois dans les bateaux."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley in Spring"
msgstr "L'orge du printemps"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The fields are dry: time to sow! Plant barley, and while it grows, sell two crates of eggs to Orm "
"in Hallvik to buy more seed."
msgstr ""
"Les champs sont secs : c'est le moment de semer ! {crew|Sème|Sème|Semez} de l'orge, et pendant "
"qu'elle pousse, {crew|vends|vends|vendez} deux caisses d'œufs à Orm, à Hallvik, pour acheter plus "
"de graines."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The barley is sown. Now the sun and the rain do the work."
msgstr "L'orge est semée. Maintenant, le soleil et la pluie font le travail."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Eggs! I make my famous egg cake. Here, good silver for good eggs."
msgstr ""
"Des œufs ! Je fais mon fameux gâteau aux œufs. {crew|Tiens|Tiens|Tenez}, du bon argent pour de "
"bons œufs."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/054_barley_in_spring/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Barley was the most important grain of the north: for bread, porridge and ale."
msgstr "L'orge était la céréale la plus importante du Nord : pour le pain, la bouillie et la bière."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Great Hold"
msgstr "La grande cale"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Now we make your boat great! Ten planks from Frosttorp, three crates of tools, and 30 silver. Then"
" she takes two more crates. Ten planks are more than you can carry at once."
msgstr ""
"Maintenant, on fait de {crew|ton|ton|votre} bateau un grand bateau ! Dix planches de Frosttorp, "
"trois caisses d'outils, et 30 pièces d'argent. Alors il prendra deux caisses de plus. Dix "
"planches, c'est plus que {crew|tu ne peux|tu ne peux|vous ne pouvez} porter d'un coup."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Planks again? Bjarne is building you a ship!"
msgstr "Encore des planches ? Bjarne {crew|te|te|vous} construit un navire !"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Iron for the rivets. Now my wages."
msgstr "Du fer pour les rivets. Maintenant, mon salaire."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Two more crates! And go and see Signe in Ekvik: she builds real ships, and my crates go with you "
"into any of them."
msgstr ""
"Deux caisses de plus ! Et {crew|va|va|allez} voir Signe à Ekvik : elle construit de vrais navires,"
" et mes caisses {crew|te|te|vous} suivent sur n'importe lequel."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/055_the_great_hold/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A knarr, the cargo ship of the vikings, could carry the load of twenty boats."
msgstr "Un knarr, le navire marchand des Vikings, pouvait porter la charge de vingt barques."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/056_bjorns_salt_run/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Bjørn's Salt Run"
msgstr "Le sel de Bjørn"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
