#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/061_the_swarm/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My bees swarmed! A whole cloud of them flew off with a young queen, and Solveig says they hang in "
"her apple tree. Bring them this empty hive, and bring them back to me."
