#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/062_the_cracked_kiln/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A potter's kiln is a small oven of clay, heated so hot that the pots glow."
msgstr ""
"Le four d'un potier est un petit four en argile, chauffé si fort que les pots deviennent rouges."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
