#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Sunny Hill"
msgstr "La colline au soleil"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My old aunt Gerd moves to Solby, to her sister. She owns the sunny hill by your farm, and says: "
"whoever rows me and my chests gets the hill! She has three chests."
msgstr ""
"Ma vieille tante Gerd part vivre chez sa sœur, à Solby. La colline au soleil près de "
"{crew|ta|ta|votre} ferme est à elle, et elle dit : celui qui m'emmène avec mes coffres aura la "
"colline ! Elle a trois coffres."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Aunt Gerd's chests? Bring her too!"
msgstr "Les coffres de tante Gerd ? {crew|Amène|Amène|Amenez}-la aussi !"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Aunt Gerd: My chests! Careful, the blue one has my grandmother's spoons."
msgstr "Tante Gerd : Mes coffres ! Attention, le bleu contient les cuillères de ma grand-mère."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/071_the_sunny_hill/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"My sister! And my chests! You are good girls. The sunny hill is yours: plant something beautiful "
"on it."
msgstr ""
"Ma sœur ! Et mes coffres ! {crew|Tu es un gentil garçon|Tu es une gentille fille|Vous êtes de "
"gentils enfants|Vous êtes de gentilles filles}. La colline au soleil est à {crew|toi|toi|vous} : "
"{crew|plantes-y|plantes-y|plantez-y} quelque chose de beau."

