"La terre d'une famille passait de la mère et du père aux enfants ; les femmes aussi pouvaient "
"posséder des terres."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "A Flock of Our Own"
msgstr "Un troupeau à nous"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"The sunny hill has the best grass. Let us have a real flock: five sheep! Buy them at the market or"
" from Sten's herders."
msgstr ""
"La colline au soleil a la meilleure herbe. Ayons un vrai troupeau : cinq moutons ! "
"{crew|Achète|Achète|Achetez}-les au marché ou chez les bergers de Sten."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Five sheep on the hill, like white clouds. We will have wool for the whole family!"
msgstr ""
"Cinq moutons sur la colline, comme des nuages blancs. On aura de la laine pour toute la famille !"

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/072_a_flock_of_our_own/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Sheep gave wool, milk, meat and skins; nothing was wasted."
msgstr "Les moutons donnaient de la laine, du lait, de la viande et des peaux ; rien n'était perdu."

#. the title of a task, also on its card (a button): a few words, at most two short lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The Bear Comes Back"
msgstr "L'ours revient"

#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Honey is missing again! But this time, the paw prints are BIG. Ask Inga the messenger, she rows "
"past the woods every day."
msgstr ""
"Il manque encore du miel ! Mais cette fois, les traces de pattes sont GRANDES. "
"{crew|Demande|Demande|Demandez} à Inga la messagère, elle passe en bateau devant les bois tous les"
" jours."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"A young bear by the woods of Hjortingsala, with a white spot on his chest. The cub you carried, "
"all grown up!"
msgstr ""
"Un jeune ours près des bois de Hjortingsala, avec une tache blanche sur la poitrine. L'ourson que "
"{crew|tu as|tu as|vous avez} porté, tout grand !"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"I put the pots by the old oak. Look! He comes out of the bushes and sniffs. He remembers you!"
msgstr ""
"J'ai posé les pots près du vieux chêne. {crew|Regarde|Regarde|Regardez} ! Il sort des buissons et "
"renifle. Il se souvient de {crew|toi|toi|vous} !"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/073_the_bear_comes_back/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Then he gets honey of his own, far from my hives. Take him two pots."
msgstr ""
"Alors il aura son miel à lui, loin de mes ruches. {crew|Apporte|Apporte|Apportez}-lui deux pots."

