"à Ålberga, et un pot de goudron d'Ekvik. D'ici là, mon feu est froid !"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/079_the_smiths_bellows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Thick hides from my old goats. They lived long and well."
msgstr "Des peaux épaisses de mes vieilles chèvres. Elles ont vécu longtemps et heureuses."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/079_the_smiths_bellows/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Whoosh! Whoosh! The fire roars again. Take two crates of my tools."
