#. what the giver of a task asks, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid ""
"Autumn again! Before the lakes freeze, fill the store: ten crates of hay and six of grain, within "
"three days. You know how by now!"
msgstr ""
"Encore l'automne ! Avant que les lacs gèlent, {crew|remplis|remplis|remplissez} la réserve : dix "
"caisses de foin et six de grain, en trois jours. {crew|Tu sais|Tu sais|Vous savez} faire, "
"maintenant !"

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Hay for all our animals. Now the grain."
msgstr "Du foin pour tous nos animaux. Maintenant, le grain."

#. what a person says, at most 6 lines
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "The store is full to the roof! Not one animal will be hungry this winter."
msgstr "La réserve est pleine jusqu'au toit ! Pas un seul animal n'aura faim cet hiver."

#. a fun fact at the end of a task, 2 short sentences
#: data/missions/096_the_winter_stores/mission.json
#, fuzzy
msgid "Autumn was the busiest time: everything for the long winter had to be in."
msgstr "L'automne était le moment le plus chargé : tout devait être rentré pour le long hiver."

